OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader forced to U-turn on
OL,4,Afunding claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has backtracked on
OL,7,Fclaims #14.6m left over from a
OL,8,Fcancelled leisure centre project was
OL,9,Fnot available to spend elsewhere in
OL,10,FBradford.
OL,12,FReform UK councillor Stephen Place had
OL,13,Faccused Shipley's Labour MP Anna Dixon
OL,14,Fof making "false claims" after she said
OL,15,Fthe money could be spent on other
OL,16,Fprojects.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
