OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader forced to U-turn on
OL,4,Afunding claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FDixon said she had forwarded a letter
OL,7,Ffrom government confirming the funding
OL,8,Ffrom the Local Regeneration Fund
OL,9,Fremained available to the council on 9
OL,10,FSeptember, but Place said he had not
OL,11,Freceived the letter until Wednesday.
OL,13,FHe has now confirmed the #14.6m from
OL,14,Fthe cancelled Squire Lane Leisure
OL,15,FCentre will be retained by Bradford
OL,16,FCouncil and can be spent on other
OL,17,Fprojects.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
